<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"wendyhicks1@sbcglobal.net","IpAddress":"99.187.229.252","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1238019840,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216154.jpg?_r=1419958783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":250,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TA Wendy","Id":216154,"Name":"TA Wendy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"205.244.233.143","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"77da10c4d4f15300879a228aa82f67a7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Are you ladies purchasing extra flowers for the ceremony? Or reception?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895086,"PostDate":1430487657,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Are you ladies purchasing extra flowers for the ceremony? Or reception?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"victoria_salv@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"205.244.233.143","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423160562,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282014.jpg?_r=1428610987","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"victoriasalv","Id":282014,"Name":"victoriasalv","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"143.58.161.6","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2663edaf5265469a0e7b2f357be3b3be","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@&lt;span&gt;&lt;a  class=\"\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282014-victoriasalv\/\" title=\"View Profile\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;victoriasalv&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;- The only additional flowers I purchased&amp;nbsp;are for my sister (MOH). I ordered a smaller bouquet to replicate mine, but in all white. We are making our own centerpieces and bring other d\u00e9cor for the welcome fiesta and reception.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895104,"PostDate":1430492425,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282014-victoriasalv\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span>victoriasalv<\/span><\/a>\u00a0- The only additional flowers I purchased\u00a0are for my sister (MOH). I ordered a smaller bouquet to replicate mine, but in all white. We are making our own centerpieces and bring other d\u00e9cor for the welcome fiesta and reception.<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jhowe114@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.98.131.98","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1402411989,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278395.jpg?_r=1421871115","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":285,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JenniferH114","Id":278395,"Name":"JenniferH114","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.75.123.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"79b14e61752a00666958c9b55db7eeed","RawContent":"[quote name=\"victoriasalv\" post=\"1895086\" timestamp=\"1430502057\"]\nAre you ladies purchasing extra flowers for the ceremony? Or reception?[\/quote]@[member=\"victoriasalv\"] - I am def purchasing additional flowers for the ceremony - and then use for the reception. Will be figuring out how many this week, but thinking atleast 4 bouquets so I can use them as centerpieces for my reception tables.\n\n2 months left for me and I&#039;m starting to stress! Need to make some decisions about decor and details.\n\nHas anyone ever used the aqua wellness at the spa? I believe it is a large pool with jets or something ? I&#039;ve read so many reviews that it&#039;s so amazing so just curious what it really consists of and if it&#039;s worth the extra $38\/day. My mom has back and neck issues so thinking she would enjoy this.","Attachments":[],"Id":1895307,"PostDate":1430756896,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>victoriasalv, on 01 May 2015 - 01:40 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Are you ladies purchasing extra flowers for the ceremony? Or reception?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282014\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282014-victoriasalv\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">victoriasalv<\/span><\/a> - I am def purchasing additional flowers for the ceremony - and then use for the reception. Will be figuring out how many this week, but thinking atleast 4 bouquets so I can use them as centerpieces for my reception tables.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>2 months left for me and I'm starting to stress! Need to make some decisions about decor and details.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Has anyone ever used the aqua wellness at the spa? I believe it is a large pool with jets or something ? I've read so many reviews that it's so amazing so just curious what it really consists of and if it's worth the extra $38\/day. My mom has back and neck issues so thinking she would enjoy this.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristinjohnson3@gmail.com","IpAddress":"184.75.123.59","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1399990051,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277949.jpg?_r=1405606592","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"upstatekj","Id":277949,"Name":"upstatekj","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.147.11.58","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ba25bc960ea4b38a1cc37f6d90bffcb1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"victoriasalv\"] -We are not doing extra flowers for the ceremony or reception (we choose the gold package, so I was happy with what it came with and Jessica let me break up the large floral centerpiece for 4 smaller ones for the reception). &amp;nbsp;I am bringing a bunch of extra decor for the tables though (2 types of votives, a runner, maracas and cute place cards for the tequila shots) I love candles more than just flowers (but that&#039;e me!). &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"upstatekj\"] -I have heard great things about the aqua wellness spa, I can let you know how it is after our wedding this month! &amp;nbsp;Might be worth it once or twice for $38.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895309,"PostDate":1430757321,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282014\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282014-victoriasalv\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">victoriasalv<\/span><\/a> -We are not doing extra flowers for the ceremony or reception (we choose the gold package, so I was happy with what it came with and Jessica let me break up the large floral centerpiece for 4 smaller ones for the reception). \u00a0I am bringing a bunch of extra decor for the tables though (2 types of votives, a runner, maracas and cute place cards for the tequila shots) I love candles more than just flowers (but that'e me!). \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277949\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277949-upstatekj\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">upstatekj<\/span><\/a> -I have heard great things about the aqua wellness spa, I can let you know how it is after our wedding this month! \u00a0Might be worth it once or twice for $38.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sabrabenes@gmail.com","IpAddress":"64.147.11.58","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403194476,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278603.jpg?_r=1405559586","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sabes44","Id":278603,"Name":"Sabes44","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"205.244.233.143","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d0d56de98f0fc7e74c51876e45297e32","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Sabes44\"] I&#039;m with you! I love candles. That&#039;s a good idea about bringing them... much cheaper. I just was confused about what to do since I am not having a bridal party, I know some corsages\/boutonnieres come with it that I won&#039;t be using. And wasn&#039;t sure about breaking up a larger thing (pending the size of our reception). Good to know Jessica is flexible. :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895360,"PostDate":1430819522,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278603\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278603-sabes44\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Sabes44<\/span><\/a> I'm with you! I love candles. That's a good idea about bringing them... much cheaper. I just was confused about what to do since I am not having a bridal party, I know some corsages\/boutonnieres come with it that I won't be using. And wasn't sure about breaking up a larger thing (pending the size of our reception). Good to know Jessica is flexible. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"victoria_salv@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"205.244.233.143","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423160562,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282014.jpg?_r=1428610987","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"victoriasalv","Id":282014,"Name":"victoriasalv","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.147.11.58","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"41b39b477025b0dcb82bdd0d463e8e19","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"victoriasalv\"] - &amp;nbsp;We are not having a bridal party either so my fiance has one of the boutonnieres, and we gave each of our dads one and his mom a corsage. &amp;nbsp;Jessica is flexible, just needs to be \"pushed\" at times and I would send her pictures of what I wanted. &amp;nbsp;As long as they can do it, they will!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895388,"PostDate":1430827205,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282014\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282014-victoriasalv\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">victoriasalv<\/span><\/a> - \u00a0We are not having a bridal party either so my fiance has one of the boutonnieres, and we gave each of our dads one and his mom a corsage. \u00a0Jessica is flexible, just needs to be \"pushed\" at times and I would send her pictures of what I wanted. \u00a0As long as they can do it, they will!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sabrabenes@gmail.com","IpAddress":"64.147.11.58","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403194476,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278603.jpg?_r=1405559586","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sabes44","Id":278603,"Name":"Sabes44","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.75.123.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"12810f3b46fca98470ca233524464a5f","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Sabes44\" post=\"1895309\" timestamp=\"1430771721\"]\n@[member=\"victoriasalv\"] -We are not doing extra flowers for the ceremony or reception (we choose the gold package, so I was happy with what it came with and Jessica let me break up the large floral centerpiece for 4 smaller ones for the reception).  I am bringing a bunch of extra decor for the tables though (2 types of votives, a runner, maracas and cute place cards for the tequila shots) I love candles more than just flowers (but that&#039;e me!).  \n\n@[member=\"upstatekj\"] -I have heard great things about the aqua wellness spa, I can let you know how it is after our wedding this month!  Might be worth it once or twice for $38.[\/quote]please do - thank you @[member=\"Sabes44\"]!","Attachments":[],"Id":1895399,"PostDate":1430829336,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Sabes44, on 04 May 2015 - 04:35 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282014\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282014-victoriasalv\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">victoriasalv<\/span><\/a> -We are not doing extra flowers for the ceremony or reception (we choose the gold package, so I was happy with what it came with and Jessica let me break up the large floral centerpiece for 4 smaller ones for the reception). \u00a0I am bringing a bunch of extra decor for the tables though (2 types of votives, a runner, maracas and cute place cards for the tequila shots) I love candles more than just flowers (but that'e me!). \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277949\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277949-upstatekj\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">upstatekj<\/span><\/a> -I have heard great things about the aqua wellness spa, I can let you know how it is after our wedding this month! \u00a0Might be worth it once or twice for $38.\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>please do - thank you @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278603\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278603-sabes44\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Sabes44<\/span><\/a>!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristinjohnson3@gmail.com","IpAddress":"184.75.123.59","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1399990051,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277949.jpg?_r=1405606592","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"upstatekj","Id":277949,"Name":"upstatekj","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"143.58.161.6","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2aa3a5483a1c8b5bf321a4af7399d960","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;In just under 48 hours we&#039;ll be on the plane to the ERC!!! I can&#039;t believe a year has gone by so quickly. :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895912,"PostDate":1431342680,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>In just under 48 hours we'll be on the plane to the ERC!!! I can't believe a year has gone by so quickly. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jhowe114@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.98.131.98","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1402411989,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278395.jpg?_r=1421871115","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":285,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JenniferH114","Id":278395,"Name":"JenniferH114","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.147.11.58","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9ee66141857616c7b35f93bb1a5d49fc","RawContent":"[quote name=\"JenniferH114\" post=\"1895912\" timestamp=\"1431357080\"]\nIn just under 48 hours we&#039;ll be on the plane to the ERC!!! I can&#039;t believe a year has gone by so quickly. :)[\/quote]Yay!!!  Have a blast and Congratulations!  I&#039;ll be getting on a plane in 16 days and can not wait!","Attachments":[],"Id":1895914,"PostDate":1431345602,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>JenniferH114, on 11 May 2015 - 11:11 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>In just under 48 hours we'll be on the plane to the ERC!!! I can't believe a year has gone by so quickly. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Yay!!! \u00a0Have a blast and Congratulations! \u00a0I'll be getting on a plane in 16 days and can not wait!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sabrabenes@gmail.com","IpAddress":"64.147.11.58","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403194476,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278603.jpg?_r=1405559586","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sabes44","Id":278603,"Name":"Sabes44","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"64583","Title":"Excellence Riviera Cancun Brides?","LastPostDate":1431601732},"Pages":{"TotalItems":1197,"TotalPages":120,"CurrentPage":1180,"NextPage":1190,"PreviousPage":1170,"LastPage":1190},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
