{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":81989,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that victoriasalv mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/64583-excellence-riviera-cancun-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1893941\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"Giocivs88\" Did Jessica send you options for cake? I haven't seen those yet! I keep hearing about one of the cakes... I'm not sure the name but if I saw it I'd .. remember! haha\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":282014,"Name":"victoriasalv","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282014.jpg?_r=1428610987","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429704594,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":81338,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that victoriasalv mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/64583-excellence-riviera-cancun-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1893658\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"Giocivs88\" Don't be bummed it's on a Saturday< I think that's great! I think if I had the same options as you (being there before and from reading this awesome forum) I would vote Foyer also. It's SO pretty. The ony thing I heard negative was it could be some heat... but they said you can request fans. The foyer is elevated as the property goes down behind it so you'll have an AWESOME view of the resort up there. I think that would be a good choice!\n \nI feel your pain about the teachers. I have so many that i'll be hoping can make to my wedding also!\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":282014,"Name":"victoriasalv","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282014.jpg?_r=1428610987","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429520625,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80377,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that hapykat mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/64583-excellence-riviera-cancun-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1893225\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"Giocivs88\" the hard liquor options are quite extensive Jessica gave me a list you'll have more than enough\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":272558,"Name":"hapykat","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272558.jpg?_r=1403105328","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429108004,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":80143,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that Sabes44 mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/64583-excellence-riviera-cancun-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1893137\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"Giocivs88\" hard liquor is included too.  Basically all liquor at the normal bars is available at the wedding bar.  I am pretty much all done!  Except for a few little things, but nothing major.  I am a event planner so that helps me out a little bit!  Do you still have a lot left??\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":278603,"Name":"Sabes44","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278603.jpg?_r=1405559586","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429042119,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79651,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that hapykat mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/64583-excellence-riviera-cancun-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1892946\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"Giocivs88\" we chose the gold package as well. Alcohol is included but be forewarned if you have foodies like my group the wine is shit!! I asked Jessica to send me a wine list it's ok so we plan on going into town and buying our own. Corkage is 20 per bottle but for people that work in fine dining it'll be worth the xtra coat\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":272558,"Name":"hapykat","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272558.jpg?_r=1403105328","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428940062,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":75205,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that JenniferH114 mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/64583-excellence-riviera-cancun-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1890771\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"Giocivs88\" - Jessica said, \"You have included a sound system during the ceremony you can bring your own music in an ipod and my staff will play it.\"\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":278395,"Name":"JenniferH114","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278395.jpg?_r=1421871115","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":285,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427300765,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":69872,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that JenniferH114 mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/64583-excellence-riviera-cancun-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1887966\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"Giocivs88\" - We locked in our ceremony time and locations pretty much right away, which was last July. At the time, I wasn't sure how many (if multiple) weddings are per day and I wanted to make sure we got the locations we wanted. Looking back, it is really a non-issue, but it certainly didn't hurt. We also booked our photographer last July. Pretty much all of the other big decisions (menus, DJ, fire show, setting hair appts, etc.) were made before the holidays (November & December). We are bringing our own centerpieces and d\u00e9cor. I think the only thing I really have left to decide on through ERC are the flowers, but I'm honestly okay with choosing those when we get there. We also have to submit our questionnaire\/info sheet to the DJ, but that's not a huge deal. We have a couple more things to order for OOT bags and favors, but we are waiting until the RSVP date (two more weeks), just in case.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":278395,"Name":"JenniferH114","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278395.jpg?_r=1421871115","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":285,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1425293390,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":"7","TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
