  'postContent' => '[quote name=\'upstatekj\' timestamp=\'1431679054\' post=\'1896369\'][quote name="Crystal17" post="1895930" timestamp="1431370433"]
Hi ladies,  just wanted to write a quick note.  We are back from our wedding and everything went perfect!  We had cermony on beach, cocktail hour on beach by Oregano and then reception at lobster house.  Our photog was Sasha Gluck and our DJ was Julian Molina from JWD Events. Both were great!  No complaints about anything.  Jessica was on top of everything.  I had a welcome dinner at Oregano and that went great as well.  This was our 4th time at Excellence and we will definitely go there for our 1yr anniversary.  If you have any questions let me know, we know this resort pretty well.  All I can say is don&#039;t stress, Jessica really had everything in order and perfect![/quote]@[member="Crystal17"], how was your hair and makeup? Was Elias still there?? Do you have any pics we can see yet? :)[/quote]
Yayyy congratulations, show us some pics :) also how did hair and makeup come out ? 
',
